{
  "id": "p15",
  "rule": "the search route: the post handler lists published posts, pages and books for every caller (a draft and, for an anonymous search, a protected post left out), a subtype of another handler falls back to posts alone, include wins over exclude; the term handler lists categories and tags by name with the taxonomy as the type, any subtype of another handler meaning every taxonomy; the post-format handler lists the formats whose term exists, ignoring subtype and include; the context, type and subtype enums; a page past the end is an empty page with zero totals and a prev link; HEAD, _fields and OPTIONS",
